KEY='life'
TITLE='How Life Changes'
FAVICON='🧬'
DESC="Heredity and evolution as six games: copy a DNA recipe and count the mistakes, hunt moths as the bird, flip peas with Mendel, race bacteria against antibiotics, drift on a small island, and rebuild the tree of life from shared differences. Every game is scored by the real probability."
EYEBROW="Heredity and evolution, K to 12"
